    "path": "/contracts/lem-hh-finite-comatrix-coalgebra-exists/citations/-",
    "value": {
      "fact": "F5",
      "source": "prop-functoriality-of-module-tensor-products",
      "source_section": "Statement",
      "quote": "Let $f:M\\to M'$ be a homomorphism of right $R$-modules and $g:N\\to N'$ a homomorphism of left $R$-modules. There is a unique group homomorphism\n\n$$f\\otimes g:M\\otimes_RN\\longrightarrow M'\\otimes_RN'$$\n\nsuch that $(f\\otimes g)(m\\otimes n)=f(m)\\otimes g(n)$. These maps satisfy\n\n$$\\operatorname{id}_M\\otimes\\operatorname{id}_N=\\operatorname{id}_{M\\otimes_RN}$$\n\nand\n\n$$(f'\\circ f)\\otimes(g'\\circ g)=(f'\\otimes g')\\circ(f\\otimes g).$$",
      "uses": [
        "2.1",
        "2.2"
      ]
    }
  },
