      "source": "thm-quotient-module-laws",
      "source_section": "Statement",
      "quote": "Let $N\\le M$ be a submodule of a left $R$-module. The rule\n\n$$r(m+N):=rm+N$$\n\nis independent of the representative $m+N$ and, together with the additive\nquotient group, makes $M/N$ a left $R$-module.",
      "uses": [
        "1.2",
        "2.1"
      ]
    }
  },
